      "writtenOn": "2021-03-22T13:29:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The SKU_ID shouldn\u0027t be used in the firmware. Instead, you should use SSFC/FW_CONFIG. SSFC is similar to FW_CONFIG which is used to switch the code path in the firmware. You can refer to baseboard/volteer/cbi_ssfc.* for the current definition. In short, we use the SSFC for the second source components which is probe-able. I think this lightbar feature should be able to probe in the factory. So, it should be okay to put it in the SSFC.",
